<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eckerd cut to underperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eckerd cut to underperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it dowgraded Eckerd Corp to underperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Sunday, Eckerd announced it would be acquired by J.C. Penney Co Inc in a deal that valued Eckerd at $35 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 33-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
